  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##Debugging Mini-Challenge\r\n\r\n- Run the code. What do you expect to see? What actually appears?”\r\n- Use the debugging checklist to find and fix the problems.\r\n\r\n::: details [<i class=\"fa fa-clipboard\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Debugging Checklist**]\r\n- Does every index exist?\r\n- Do IDs in getElementById match the HTML?\r\n- Does .length equal the number of items?\r\n- Are you using length - 1 for the last item?\r\n:::\r\n&nbsp\r\n\r\nYou may ask **AI** to explain why a bug is happening, then compare its explanation to your own and decide which fix is clearest and safest.\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
